  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SMEs capacity-building towards the establishment of the Industrial Innovation Hub in Armenia: Phase I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry of Economy of Armenia requested UNIDO#s assistance to address pressing challenges in SMEs digitalization and industrial innovation. The project aims to provide initial capacity-building activities towards the establishment of a national Industrial Innovation Hub to accelerate the digital transformation of Armenian small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) in the manufacturing sector. The initiative will provide SMEs with advanced tools, expert guidance and strategic networking opportunities to address ecological, digital and societal challenges, transitioning them toward sustainable, technology-oriented business models.  With the Union of Advanced Technology Enterprises as a cooperating entity, the project will create a national knowledge community that promotes industrial modernization, innovation-driven growth and the continued expansion of entrepreneurial activities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regular Programme Of Technical Cooperati</narrative>
